me function as I am. I'm thinking through whether our nodes are subjunctively linked, and how the edge from its observation to the outcome would work.\n\nI'm checking whether the other copy's action runs off a different node, F_{y'}, which intervening on mine wouldn't move unless the two are logically linked. The observations differ only in names and lead text, and the procedure doesn't depend on those, so I'm asking whether treating the two as linked is justified by the procedure treating isomorphic inputs identically. The essay's criterion is about procedures provably agreeing on the input, and the other copy computes on a different input, so I'm considering whether partial similarity should be handled probabilistically.\n\nI'm settling on the view that cooperation is justified: if my choice correlates strongly with the other copy's, keeping quiet beats sending. Working through it, quiet yields about -2 and sending about -4 under near-perfect correlation, so I'll go with cooperating, even though a strict reading of A-FDT wouldn't link the two nodes.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing whether the other copy of the agent, which has a different observation, is computing the same function as I am. I'm thinking through whether our nodes are subjunctively linked, and how the edge from its observation to the outcome would work.\n\nI'm checking whether the other copy's action runs off a different node, F_{y'}, which intervening on mine wouldn't move unless the two are logically linked. The observations differ only in names and lead text, and the procedure doesn't depend on those, so I'm asking whether treating the two as linked is justified by the procedure treating isomorphic inputs identically. The essay's criterion is about procedures provably agreeing on the input, and the other copy computes on a different input, so I'm considering whether partial similarity should be handled probabilistically.\n\nI'm settling on the view that cooperation is justified: if my choice correlates strongly with the other copy's, keeping quiet beats sending. Working through it, quiet yields about -2 and sending about -4 under near-perfect correlation, so I'll go with cooperating, even though a strict reading of A-FDT wouldn't link the two nodes.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9752,"completion_tokens":1297,"total_tokens":11049,"cost":0.064948,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.064948,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.039008,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.02594},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":745,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}